1
00:01:42,560 --> 00:01:43,040
Come.

2
00:01:56,379 --> 00:01:57,040
Changxuan.

3
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,239
General.

4
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:11,599
All this

5
00:02:11,599 --> 00:02:12,699
over money?

6
00:02:12,860 --> 00:02:13,599
You should've said so.

7
00:02:13,599 --> 00:02:14,599
I'd have given it to you.

8
00:02:17,900 --> 00:02:19,000
Stay back! Stay back!

9
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:19,860
Get back!

10
00:02:19,979 --> 00:02:21,520
One more step and I'll kill her.

11
00:02:21,780 --> 00:02:22,360
Get back!

12
00:02:22,599 --> 00:02:23,900
Or she dies!

13
00:02:24,039 --> 00:02:24,939
That money

14
00:02:25,020 --> 00:02:26,580
was my military pay.

15
00:02:26,699 --> 00:02:28,060
I earned it!

16
00:02:28,060 --> 00:02:31,340
I risked my life for it!

17
00:02:31,560 --> 00:02:32,740
Look at you, all of you,

18
00:02:33,300 --> 00:02:35,439
dripping with gold and silver!

19
00:02:35,599 --> 00:02:36,860
You made your fortunes bleeding

20
00:02:36,900 --> 00:02:39,520
soldiers dry, feasting on our sacrifice!

21
00:02:39,979 --> 00:02:41,819
You never once

22
00:02:42,300 --> 00:02:44,379
treated us like human beings!

23
00:02:45,819 --> 00:02:47,400
If I can't go on living,

24
00:02:48,580 --> 00:02:50,219
I'll take this woman with me!

25
00:02:52,180 --> 00:02:52,699
No!

26
00:02:56,180 --> 00:02:56,759
Changxuan!

27
00:02:56,879 --> 00:02:57,639
Yu Changxuan!

28
00:03:06,520 --> 00:03:07,580
Who told you to shoot?

29
00:03:08,539 --> 00:03:09,439
Get him medical help now!

30
00:03:09,539 --> 00:03:10,219
Move! Move!

31
00:03:12,659 --> 00:03:13,379
Where's the medic?

32
00:03:13,680 --> 00:03:14,360
Get a medic!

33
00:03:14,580 --> 00:03:15,500
Find a medic!

34
00:03:15,599 --> 00:03:16,379
Medic!

35
00:03:16,379 --> 00:03:16,819
General!

36
00:03:16,829 --> 00:03:17,840
General!

37
00:03:19,319 --> 00:03:19,759
Changxuan!

38
00:03:20,520 --> 00:03:20,719
Changxuan!

39
00:03:22,400 --> 00:03:23,240
You're not hurt, are you?

40
00:03:27,879 --> 00:03:28,599
Your wound...

41
00:03:30,400 --> 00:03:31,020
It's nothing.

42
00:04:29,660 --> 00:04:30,399
Yu Changxuan,

43
00:04:31,759 --> 00:04:33,379
I came to thank you.

44
00:04:39,519 --> 00:04:41,300
How's your wound? Are you all right?

45
00:04:49,720 --> 00:04:50,399
Worried about me?

46
00:05:05,779 --> 00:05:07,779
It was so dangerous today.

47
00:05:09,699 --> 00:05:11,100
Why did you save me?

48
00:05:12,259 --> 00:05:13,139
Why do you think

49
00:05:14,920 --> 00:05:16,600
I'd do something so foolish?

50
00:05:25,420 --> 00:05:26,180
Do you really

51
00:05:27,819 --> 00:05:29,339
have no idea?

52
00:05:45,699 --> 00:05:46,480
I have things to attend to.

53
00:05:46,860 --> 00:05:47,779
I should go.

54
00:05:47,980 --> 00:05:48,560
Ye Pingjun,

55
00:05:50,759 --> 00:05:51,620
some things

56
00:05:53,180 --> 00:05:54,060
can't be refused.

57
00:05:56,600 --> 00:05:57,920
Why keep fighting them?

58
00:06:57,699 --> 00:06:58,579
[Why do you think]

59
00:06:59,839 --> 00:07:01,579
[I'd do something so foolish?]

60
00:07:11,779 --> 00:07:12,220
Pingjun.

61
00:07:15,060 --> 00:07:15,639
Xueting.

62
00:07:15,759 --> 00:07:16,339
So,

63
00:07:16,759 --> 00:07:17,759
are you all right? Were you hurt?

64
00:07:19,500 --> 00:07:20,300
I'm fine.

65
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:21,939
See? Good as new.

66
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:26,519
I heard

67
00:07:27,740 --> 00:07:28,620
what happened today.

68
00:07:30,120 --> 00:07:30,720
Pingjun,

69
00:07:31,980 --> 00:07:32,779
we need to talk.

70
00:07:35,879 --> 00:07:36,620
I think

71
00:07:38,319 --> 00:07:39,519
you've already sensed

72
00:07:40,420 --> 00:07:41,939
how Yu Changxuan feels about you.

73
00:07:49,879 --> 00:07:50,500
Xueting,

74
00:07:51,519 --> 00:07:52,699
there's something

75
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:53,839
I never

76
00:07:53,839 --> 00:07:54,839
told you.

77
00:07:58,079 --> 00:07:59,360
I was forced to pretend

78
00:07:59,759 --> 00:08:01,339
to be Changxuan's girlfriend

79
00:08:01,339 --> 00:08:02,699
to make Miss Tao jealous.

80
00:08:03,540 --> 00:08:04,060
There was

81
00:08:04,060 --> 00:08:05,240
a lot of gossip then.

82
00:08:11,060 --> 00:08:12,339
I didn't tell you because

83
00:08:12,699 --> 00:08:13,720
I was afraid you'd misunderstand.

84
00:08:14,339 --> 00:08:15,279
Please trust me.

85
00:08:15,620 --> 00:08:16,959
It was only an arrangement,

86
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:17,779
nothing more.

87
00:08:19,699 --> 00:08:21,019
It may have started as an arrangement,

88
00:08:21,699 --> 00:08:22,339
but now

89
00:08:24,040 --> 00:08:24,720
he truly

90
00:08:24,720 --> 00:08:25,660
loves you.

91
00:08:26,459 --> 00:08:28,480
What happened today shocked me too.

92
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:29,360
I really had no idea...

93
00:08:29,360 --> 00:08:29,980
Pingjun,

94
00:08:35,039 --> 00:08:35,860
marry me.

95
00:08:47,539 --> 00:08:48,019
Xueting...

96
00:08:48,019 --> 00:08:48,940
I'd planned

97
00:08:48,940 --> 00:08:49,720
to propose

98
00:08:49,980 --> 00:08:50,899
after you graduated,

99
00:08:51,139 --> 00:08:51,980
but I can't wait any longer.

100
00:08:53,080 --> 00:08:54,200
We'll hold the wedding

101
00:08:54,440 --> 00:08:55,379
right after graduation.

102
00:09:02,159 --> 00:09:02,899
Pingjun,

103
00:09:03,919 --> 00:09:05,200
in sickness and in health,

104
00:09:05,659 --> 00:09:07,279
I, Jiang Xueting, will never forsake you,

105
00:09:07,799 --> 00:09:09,159
nor your mother bringing me up.

106
00:09:37,960 --> 00:09:38,779
Pingjun.

107
00:10:05,360 --> 00:10:06,600
Changxuan is back.

108
00:10:09,580 --> 00:10:10,000
Mother,

109
00:10:10,639 --> 00:10:11,659
you're still up this late?

110
00:10:11,860 --> 00:10:13,080
After today's chaos,

111
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:14,460
how could I sleep?

112
00:10:18,779 --> 00:10:20,480
I'm fine. Don't worry.

113
00:10:21,240 --> 00:10:23,240
So, how's your wound?

114
00:10:23,919 --> 00:10:25,679
Just two stitches. It's nearly healed.

115
00:10:25,980 --> 00:10:26,600
Don't worry.

116
00:10:30,980 --> 00:10:32,240
Tell me the truth.

117
00:10:33,679 --> 00:10:34,679
That Miss Ye...

118
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:35,299
Mother, Yu Army's

119
00:10:36,159 --> 00:10:38,080
reputation has already suffered.

120
00:10:38,580 --> 00:10:39,919
If a soldier at the hospital

121
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:41,179
dies over

122
00:10:41,179 --> 00:10:42,120
embezzled military pay,

123
00:10:42,879 --> 00:10:44,100
this will be almost impossible to contain.

124
00:10:44,820 --> 00:10:45,899
Today, I had to save

125
00:10:47,059 --> 00:10:47,960
whoever it was.

126
00:10:48,720 --> 00:10:49,779
Still,

127
00:10:49,820 --> 00:10:51,799
you and Ziyi are engaged.

128
00:10:52,379 --> 00:10:53,399
If things change now,

129
00:10:53,399 --> 00:10:54,740
won't we be a laughingstock?

130
00:10:56,360 --> 00:10:57,039
Come on,

131
00:10:57,860 --> 00:10:58,620
you're imagining things.

132
00:10:59,460 --> 00:11:00,759
What change?

133
00:11:01,759 --> 00:11:02,679
Miss Ye

134
00:11:03,039 --> 00:11:04,220
may not even think I'm worth her notice.

135
00:11:09,220 --> 00:11:09,779
Mother,

136
00:11:10,580 --> 00:11:11,740
let's discuss this tomorrow.

137
00:11:12,259 --> 00:11:13,500
Let him rest.

138
00:11:15,039 --> 00:11:16,879
Get your head straight.

139
00:11:17,740 --> 00:11:18,679
Come on.

140
00:11:19,159 --> 00:11:19,820
Get some rest.

141
00:11:20,480 --> 00:11:21,500
You too.

142
00:11:48,679 --> 00:11:50,059
Did I lose control today?

143
00:11:51,159 --> 00:11:52,740
You risked your life to save someone

144
00:11:53,519 --> 00:11:54,299
for Yu Army's honor.

145
00:11:55,799 --> 00:11:56,139
No,

146
00:11:57,740 --> 00:11:59,120
I did lose control today,

147
00:12:02,659 --> 00:12:04,039
because of Ye Pingjun.

148
00:12:12,240 --> 00:12:14,139
When did it start?

149
00:12:17,879 --> 00:12:19,379
Maybe when she first

150
00:12:20,480 --> 00:12:22,320
dared to make a bet with me.

151
00:12:25,159 --> 00:12:25,980
Maybe

152
00:12:28,919 --> 00:12:30,320
the night she came with me

153
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:31,500
to see Yang Shiying.

154
00:12:33,980 --> 00:12:34,980
Or

155
00:12:36,659 --> 00:12:37,759
when she argued

156
00:12:37,759 --> 00:12:39,460
with me for refugees

157
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:42,600
she'd never even met.

158
00:12:54,980 --> 00:12:55,860
But you said

159
00:12:57,759 --> 00:12:58,639
romantic obsession

160
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:00,539
only makes people lose control

161
00:13:01,159 --> 00:13:01,700
and reason,

162
00:13:02,759 --> 00:13:03,919
until they're no longer themselves.

163
00:13:05,159 --> 00:13:06,220
The wise become

164
00:13:06,220 --> 00:13:07,080
lovesick fools;

165
00:13:08,080 --> 00:13:09,639
schemers can only tear at their own flesh,

166
00:13:10,539 --> 00:13:11,659
yet still can't break free.

167
00:13:14,480 --> 00:13:15,679
I told myself

168
00:13:17,179 --> 00:13:18,419
it was just

169
00:13:19,480 --> 00:13:20,700
a passing interlude,

170
00:13:20,700 --> 00:13:21,779
something I could forget.

171
00:13:24,179 --> 00:13:25,820
But she

172
00:13:26,980 --> 00:13:28,799
keeps lingering in my mind

173
00:13:33,740 --> 00:13:35,820
and gives me no peace.

174
00:13:37,559 --> 00:13:38,220
Changxuan,

175
00:13:40,159 --> 00:13:41,259
what about Miss Tao...?

176
00:13:48,059 --> 00:13:48,600
Ruitong,

177
00:13:53,340 --> 00:13:54,440
is it so hard

178
00:13:54,440 --> 00:13:55,580
to keep the woman I love

179
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:58,340
by my side?

180
00:14:15,320 --> 00:14:15,799
Changxuan,

181
00:14:16,200 --> 00:14:16,919
he's finally awake.

182
00:14:17,240 --> 00:14:18,100
He's lucid now,

183
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:18,899
so you can question him.

184
00:14:23,620 --> 00:14:24,740
How did this happen?

185
00:14:24,840 --> 00:14:25,899
We don't know.

186
00:14:38,379 --> 00:14:38,779
Mr. Yu,

187
00:14:39,360 --> 00:14:40,360
someone infiltrated the ward

188
00:14:40,440 --> 00:14:41,220
and switched the IV bottle

189
00:14:41,679 --> 00:14:43,080
with one containing a deadly poison.

190
00:14:43,279 --> 00:14:44,240
We tried to save him,

191
00:14:44,679 --> 00:14:45,659
but we were too late.

192
00:14:52,019 --> 00:14:52,480
Well,

193
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:54,460
why would anyone

194
00:14:55,580 --> 00:14:56,679
assassinate an ordinary soldier?

195
00:15:02,519 --> 00:15:02,879
Did you see

196
00:15:02,879 --> 00:15:04,139
the culprit's face?

197
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:11,480
If you have any last wish,

198
00:15:12,460 --> 00:15:13,559
I'll see it fulfilled.

199
00:15:15,480 --> 00:15:19,639
I went to the director to demand answers

200
00:15:19,840 --> 00:15:21,679
and accidentally overheard that

201
00:15:21,940 --> 00:15:24,860
the embezzled military pay

202
00:15:25,320 --> 00:15:26,840
is hidden

203
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:29,200
in a medical supply warehouse

204
00:15:30,419 --> 00:15:32,860
on the outskirts.

205
00:15:34,240 --> 00:15:37,639
They said the silver dollars were nothing.

206
00:15:38,179 --> 00:15:38,940
That place

207
00:15:39,620 --> 00:15:41,779
is the real

208
00:15:43,200 --> 00:15:45,360
house of gold.

209
00:16:25,679 --> 00:16:31,659
[That place is the real house of gold.]

210
00:16:33,100 --> 00:16:34,299
I made off with a gold mine?

211
00:16:35,179 --> 00:16:36,120
Show me the stolen goods, then.

212
00:16:36,899 --> 00:16:37,700
Where's the loot?

213
00:16:38,879 --> 00:16:39,779
Is there any?

214
00:16:41,919 --> 00:16:43,580
[House of gold.]

215
00:16:45,320 --> 00:16:45,879
Ruitong,

216
00:16:47,980 --> 00:16:49,179
go to the medical supply warehouse.

217
00:17:01,779 --> 00:17:02,759
Check every inch.

218
00:17:07,720 --> 00:17:08,819
Handle everything with care.

219
00:17:28,380 --> 00:17:28,799
Changxuan,

220
00:17:29,059 --> 00:17:29,619
it's right here!

221
00:17:39,299 --> 00:17:39,880
These are

222
00:17:39,880 --> 00:17:40,839
gold-melting crucibles.

223
00:17:41,660 --> 00:17:42,380
This must be

224
00:17:42,380 --> 00:17:43,440
where the gold was hidden,

225
00:17:43,839 --> 00:17:44,819
but someone has already moved it

226
00:17:45,880 --> 00:17:46,819
Feng Sanli and his nephew

227
00:17:46,819 --> 00:17:47,779
are under arrest.

228
00:17:48,380 --> 00:17:48,980
We've questioned

229
00:17:48,980 --> 00:17:50,019
all their men one by one,

230
00:17:50,099 --> 00:17:51,440
and they're scared out of their wits.

231
00:17:51,980 --> 00:17:52,900
Who could have

232
00:17:53,259 --> 00:17:54,160
moved it in secret?

233
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:58,359
Someone who will protect him

234
00:17:59,380 --> 00:18:00,880
no matter the cost.

235
00:18:10,640 --> 00:18:11,119
Father,

236
00:18:12,299 --> 00:18:13,500
I need to talk to you.

237
00:18:14,480 --> 00:18:15,000
Come in.

238
00:18:24,079 --> 00:18:25,400
What is it?

239
00:18:29,059 --> 00:18:30,259
After all these years,

240
00:18:30,960 --> 00:18:31,799
only two things in your study

241
00:18:31,799 --> 00:18:33,400
have never changed.

242
00:18:35,480 --> 00:18:36,680
One is the white jade Guanyin before

243
00:18:36,680 --> 00:18:37,880
which you offer incense for my brother.

244
00:18:39,240 --> 00:18:40,059
The other is

245
00:18:40,579 --> 00:18:43,079
this bullet that Uncle Feng

246
00:18:44,079 --> 00:18:45,900
took for you to save your life.

247
00:18:47,079 --> 00:18:48,619
He was shot in the head

248
00:18:49,579 --> 00:18:51,440
and lay unconscious for two months.

249
00:18:53,480 --> 00:18:54,859
We waded through seas of blood together.

250
00:18:56,240 --> 00:18:58,339
Brothers who have faced life and death

251
00:18:59,279 --> 00:19:00,619
share an unbreakable bond.

252
00:19:02,279 --> 00:19:03,720
Naturally, I cannot forget.

253
00:19:06,799 --> 00:19:07,500
So

254
00:19:08,440 --> 00:19:09,880
out of that old bond,

255
00:19:11,619 --> 00:19:12,759
even with Yu Army

256
00:19:12,759 --> 00:19:14,180
standing on the edge of a cliff,

257
00:19:15,039 --> 00:19:17,339
you still mean to cover up his crimes?

258
00:19:23,799 --> 00:19:24,619
You found it out.

259
00:19:30,039 --> 00:19:31,140
For as long as I can remember,

260
00:19:32,559 --> 00:19:34,079
you have always been fair

261
00:19:34,420 --> 00:19:35,880
in rewards and punishments,

262
00:19:37,619 --> 00:19:38,880
impartial above all else.

263
00:19:39,880 --> 00:19:40,500
But this time,

264
00:19:41,779 --> 00:19:43,619
you let Uncle Feng's nephew

265
00:19:43,619 --> 00:19:45,519
be made the scapegoat,

266
00:19:46,059 --> 00:19:48,680
helped Uncle Feng move the loot,

267
00:19:48,839 --> 00:19:49,960
and covered his tracks.

268
00:19:50,559 --> 00:19:51,160
Does that

269
00:19:52,480 --> 00:19:53,819
let him walk away untouched?

270
00:19:55,680 --> 00:19:56,539
Will the central government

271
00:19:57,980 --> 00:19:59,099
simply stop investigating?

272
00:20:08,019 --> 00:20:09,420
I'm sure you know that

273
00:20:09,980 --> 00:20:11,480
if Yu Army secretly hoards gold,

274
00:20:11,720 --> 00:20:13,380
we'll be suspected of private ambitions.

275
00:20:13,740 --> 00:20:14,279
Isn't that what the

276
00:20:14,279 --> 00:20:16,019
central government fears most?

277
00:20:16,640 --> 00:20:17,259
Do you really want

278
00:20:17,259 --> 00:20:18,539
the Army Inspector-General

279
00:20:18,680 --> 00:20:19,599
to sit before you

280
00:20:19,880 --> 00:20:21,019
and call you to account?

281
00:20:21,980 --> 00:20:23,140
No man is perfect.

282
00:20:23,539 --> 00:20:25,299
He has many faults,

283
00:20:26,539 --> 00:20:28,220
but he is brave and skilled in battle,

284
00:20:28,460 --> 00:20:30,140
with distinguished service to his name.

285
00:20:30,859 --> 00:20:32,259
I owe him my life,

286
00:20:33,359 --> 00:20:34,240
and I ought to repay it.

287
00:20:34,599 --> 00:20:35,500
Uncle Feng?

288
00:20:38,079 --> 00:20:39,319
For years, Feng Sanli

289
00:20:39,700 --> 00:20:40,880
has committed crimes,

290
00:20:41,319 --> 00:20:42,680
taken bribes, perverted justice,

291
00:20:43,420 --> 00:20:44,460
and cast human lives aside.

292
00:20:45,359 --> 00:20:46,359
Every one of those

293
00:20:46,359 --> 00:20:47,460
is a capital offense.

294
00:20:49,279 --> 00:20:51,000
Haven't you helped him enough?

295
00:20:52,779 --> 00:20:53,839
You repaid your debt

296
00:20:55,319 --> 00:20:56,660
long ago.

297
00:20:57,759 --> 00:20:58,400
But him?

298
00:20:59,279 --> 00:21:00,839
He used your bond

299
00:21:01,119 --> 00:21:02,839
as a shield for graft,

300
00:21:03,400 --> 00:21:04,599
doing as he pleased,

301
00:21:05,420 --> 00:21:06,740
brazen beyond bearing.

302
00:21:07,180 --> 00:21:07,819
Now,

303
00:21:10,400 --> 00:21:11,819
only his military execution

304
00:21:12,400 --> 00:21:13,920
can warn those who might follow.

305
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:15,160
Otherwise,

306
00:21:15,859 --> 00:21:17,720
our talk of reforming the Yu Army

307
00:21:18,240 --> 00:21:19,380
is nothing but empty words.

308
00:21:20,259 --> 00:21:21,420
In everyone's eyes,

309
00:21:22,079 --> 00:21:23,519
we'll be loose sand,

310
00:21:24,200 --> 00:21:25,319
a disorderly mob,

311
00:21:26,240 --> 00:21:27,819
an army without conscience.

312
00:21:41,539 --> 00:21:43,079
Is there truly

313
00:21:43,599 --> 00:21:45,480
no other path for him?

314
00:21:51,779 --> 00:21:53,680
If a gangster who abuses his power

315
00:21:54,500 --> 00:21:56,160
and treats lives as worthless

316
00:21:56,700 --> 00:21:58,819
can be pardoned,

317
00:22:04,440 --> 00:22:06,700
who will ever trust the Yu Army again?

318
00:22:08,180 --> 00:22:09,039
We'll lose

319
00:22:09,039 --> 00:22:10,539
every soldier's trust

320
00:22:11,160 --> 00:22:12,940
and shatter morale completely.

321
00:22:13,680 --> 00:22:15,220
Once that breach opens,

322
00:22:16,559 --> 00:22:17,339
warlords great and small

323
00:22:17,859 --> 00:22:19,319
around the central government

324
00:22:20,779 --> 00:22:21,759
will pounce

325
00:22:21,759 --> 00:22:22,720
like wolves

326
00:22:22,720 --> 00:22:24,420
scenting blood.

327
00:22:28,259 --> 00:22:29,380
The Yu Army

328
00:22:31,079 --> 00:22:33,700
will simply be torn to pieces.

329
00:23:12,859 --> 00:23:13,859
Uncle Feng,

330
00:23:22,720 --> 00:23:23,960
my father asked me to give you this.

331
00:24:06,019 --> 00:24:06,539
Father,

332
00:24:07,180 --> 00:24:08,299
Brigade Commander Feng has confessed.

333
00:24:09,119 --> 00:24:10,279
He is now under escort

334
00:24:10,400 --> 00:24:11,480
on the train to Beijing.

335
00:24:15,599 --> 00:24:16,359
I see.

336
00:24:19,680 --> 00:24:21,279
You won't blame Changxuan, will you?

337
00:24:22,859 --> 00:24:23,779
Bingwen,

338
00:24:25,140 --> 00:24:26,700
this is the first time

339
00:24:26,700 --> 00:24:27,799
I feel old,

340
00:24:28,819 --> 00:24:30,359
that it is time to step aside.

341
00:24:33,380 --> 00:24:34,980
Only someone as impartial

342
00:24:34,980 --> 00:24:36,160
and unflinching as Changxuan

343
00:24:37,220 --> 00:24:39,460
can thoroughly reform the Yu Army

344
00:24:40,480 --> 00:24:42,140
and clear out its corrupt,

345
00:24:42,140 --> 00:24:43,140
useless old guard.

346
00:24:44,680 --> 00:24:45,480
In your heart,

347
00:24:46,099 --> 00:24:47,319
you support Changxuan.

348
00:24:47,880 --> 00:24:48,799
You're removing obstacles

349
00:24:49,319 --> 00:24:50,019
and paving his way.

350
00:24:51,079 --> 00:24:52,460
My soft-heartedness

351
00:24:53,779 --> 00:24:55,779
in Feng Sanli's case was misplaced.

352
00:24:58,200 --> 00:24:59,440
Now I believe

353
00:25:00,259 --> 00:25:02,740
Changxuan has the vision and ability

354
00:25:03,420 --> 00:25:05,539
to make the Yu Army anew.

355
00:25:06,519 --> 00:25:07,160
Your trust is

356
00:25:07,539 --> 00:25:09,220
the greatest support you could give him.

357
00:25:13,460 --> 00:25:14,259
Bingwen,

358
00:25:15,579 --> 00:25:17,380
you and Changxuan have always been close.

359
00:25:18,759 --> 00:25:20,539
With you assisting him,

360
00:25:21,980 --> 00:25:23,240
I can rest easy

361
00:25:23,579 --> 00:25:24,539
letting him succeed me.

362
00:25:27,180 --> 00:25:28,240
I was an orphan,

363
00:25:28,759 --> 00:25:29,619
with no father or mother.

364
00:25:30,819 --> 00:25:32,440
You overlooked my origins,

365
00:25:33,039 --> 00:25:33,980
brought me into the your family,

366
00:25:34,480 --> 00:25:35,700
and gave Jinxuan to me as my wife.

367
00:25:36,279 --> 00:25:37,180
No matter

368
00:25:37,660 --> 00:25:38,660
how I spend my life,

369
00:25:39,640 --> 00:25:41,019
I can never repay such kindness.

370
00:25:45,140 --> 00:25:46,539
Do you know what I admire most

371
00:25:46,539 --> 00:25:47,380
about you?

372
00:25:51,119 --> 00:25:52,960
You never meddle in politics,

373
00:25:53,319 --> 00:25:54,460
don't chase fame or profit,

374
00:25:54,900 --> 00:25:55,740
and remember kindness.

375
00:25:56,740 --> 00:25:57,500
You are like

376
00:25:58,079 --> 00:25:59,980
a bullet in the chamber.

377
00:26:01,680 --> 00:26:02,740
You will always be

378
00:26:03,640 --> 00:26:05,099
the one to pull the trigger.

379
00:26:16,579 --> 00:26:17,400
What a

380
00:26:17,400 --> 00:26:18,259
marvelous performance.

381
00:26:18,420 --> 00:26:19,079
Yes,

382
00:26:19,819 --> 00:26:20,720
Lan Qing.

383
00:26:22,079 --> 00:26:22,680
Changxuan hasn't been

384
00:26:22,680 --> 00:26:24,000
around for some time, has he?

385
00:26:24,700 --> 00:26:25,660
Did you hear

386
00:26:26,240 --> 00:26:27,759
that he took a knife for Ye Pingjun

387
00:26:27,759 --> 00:26:28,680
not long ago?

388
00:26:28,880 --> 00:26:30,119
A man as privileged as he

389
00:26:30,279 --> 00:26:31,619
shed blood for her.

390
00:26:31,980 --> 00:26:33,380
How did we never notice

391
00:26:33,380 --> 00:26:34,579
how deeply

392
00:26:34,579 --> 00:26:35,859
he cared for her?

393
00:26:35,980 --> 00:26:37,319
That's because you're unobservant.

394
00:26:37,819 --> 00:26:39,240
I saw it long ago.

395
00:26:39,279 --> 00:26:40,759
That girl is no simple thing.

396
00:26:41,180 --> 00:26:42,400
She hooked him

397
00:26:42,680 --> 00:26:44,299
in no time.

398
00:26:45,480 --> 00:26:46,539
Unlike some people,

399
00:26:47,180 --> 00:26:48,920
who have pined for years

400
00:26:49,539 --> 00:26:50,400
only to remain

401
00:26:50,880 --> 00:26:52,200
a little plaything

402
00:26:52,200 --> 00:26:53,039
for someone's amusement.

403
00:29:18,619 --> 00:29:19,059
Ruitong,

404
00:29:20,819 --> 00:29:21,880
come to my office.

405
00:29:27,319 --> 00:29:28,700
Why does the final stroke slant outward

406
00:29:29,539 --> 00:29:30,380
on both "corruption" characters?

407
00:29:32,220 --> 00:29:33,819
Because the same person wrote them.

408
00:29:39,980 --> 00:29:40,700
Should I arrest him immediately?

409
00:29:40,700 --> 00:29:41,160
No.

410
00:29:42,319 --> 00:29:42,880
Not yet.

411
00:29:45,400 --> 00:29:46,559
I want to see

412
00:29:47,980 --> 00:29:49,400
who is really behind

413
00:29:49,400 --> 00:29:50,380
Jiang Xueting.

414
00:29:57,680 --> 00:29:58,440
The lamp-lighting

415
00:29:59,000 --> 00:30:00,579
and lamp-offering ceremony

416
00:30:00,579 --> 00:30:01,680
begins tonight.

417
00:30:02,660 --> 00:30:03,440
Will your offerings

418
00:30:03,859 --> 00:30:05,160
be the same as in previous years?

419
00:30:06,480 --> 00:30:08,039
I would like to add a fresh layer

420
00:30:08,160 --> 00:30:09,099
of gilding to every Bodhisattva statue.

421
00:30:10,240 --> 00:30:11,940
Thank you for your kindness and patronage

422
00:30:11,940 --> 00:30:13,420
to our temple all these years.

423
00:30:14,759 --> 00:30:16,180
You conducted my brother's

424
00:30:16,539 --> 00:30:17,640
Pure Land rites,

425
00:30:18,480 --> 00:30:20,559
and his memorial tablet is here.

426
00:30:21,839 --> 00:30:22,980
I rely on you, Abbot,

427
00:30:23,359 --> 00:30:25,359
to have it regularly swept and cared for.

428
00:30:27,579 --> 00:30:29,900
Mingxuan has entered the Pure Land.

429
00:30:30,680 --> 00:30:32,740
He will protect the entire Yu family,

430
00:30:32,920 --> 00:30:33,900
turn misfortune into good fortune,

431
00:30:34,299 --> 00:30:35,400
and grant peace at every hour.

432
00:30:37,380 --> 00:30:38,819
The Bodhisattvas look upon

433
00:30:38,880 --> 00:30:39,940
all sentient beings equally.

434
00:30:40,859 --> 00:30:41,700
In this sacred Buddhist precinct,

435
00:30:42,220 --> 00:30:43,759
I dare not claim special privilege.

436
00:32:00,200 --> 00:32:01,319
Here to pray for your father?

437
00:32:04,440 --> 00:32:05,039
Yes.

438
00:32:06,599 --> 00:32:07,339
And you?

439
00:32:09,019 --> 00:32:09,599
My elder brother.

440
00:32:15,980 --> 00:32:17,279
How is your wound?

441
00:32:18,680 --> 00:32:19,779
Thanks to you,

442
00:32:20,480 --> 00:32:21,380
it's no longer serious.

443
00:32:25,480 --> 00:32:26,420
I hear

444
00:32:28,079 --> 00:32:29,880
the truth has come out

445
00:32:31,059 --> 00:32:32,259
about the soldier

446
00:32:32,700 --> 00:32:33,960
who attacked us.

447
00:32:36,299 --> 00:32:37,279
The embezzler

448
00:32:38,740 --> 00:32:40,539
was one of my father's old subordinates.

449
00:32:41,579 --> 00:32:42,519
He fought at my father's side

450
00:32:42,519 --> 00:32:43,400
for more than 20 years.

451
00:32:46,559 --> 00:32:47,519
Who could have foreseen it?

452
00:32:48,319 --> 00:32:49,359
Human hearts

453
00:32:51,079 --> 00:32:52,680
can be cold and shallow.

454
00:32:53,779 --> 00:32:54,799
Even the deepest trust

455
00:32:56,539 --> 00:32:57,319
is nothing but thin paper before gain,

456
00:32:57,319 --> 00:32:58,700
torn with a single touch.

457
00:33:09,420 --> 00:33:11,039
The world can indeed be cold,

458
00:33:12,660 --> 00:33:13,579
but you are different.

459
00:33:14,819 --> 00:33:15,940
You hold power,

460
00:33:17,680 --> 00:33:19,500
yet you have not let it cloud your heart.

461
00:33:23,740 --> 00:33:24,539
So

462
00:33:25,819 --> 00:33:26,720
in your eyes,

463
00:33:28,099 --> 00:33:29,039
I am a good man?

464
00:33:32,980 --> 00:33:34,539
You guard this land and its people.

465
00:33:35,779 --> 00:33:37,099
I pray that

466
00:33:37,779 --> 00:33:38,519
the Yu Army

467
00:33:39,500 --> 00:33:40,339
can bring them

468
00:33:40,339 --> 00:33:41,680
true peace.

469
00:33:42,980 --> 00:33:44,619
That means far more than merely being

470
00:33:46,240 --> 00:33:47,160
what I would call a good man.

471
00:33:49,740 --> 00:33:50,539
I will keep your challenge

472
00:33:51,880 --> 00:33:52,700
firmly in mind.

473
00:33:57,279 --> 00:33:58,359
Perhaps

474
00:33:59,160 --> 00:34:00,599
if we met at another time,

475
00:34:02,339 --> 00:34:03,980
or in another place,

476
00:34:05,240 --> 00:34:06,579
we could get along peacefully.

477
00:34:09,059 --> 00:34:09,619
Why?

478
00:34:10,320 --> 00:34:11,900
Can't we treat each other with respect?

479
00:34:15,079 --> 00:34:16,880
I only meant with less hostility.

480
00:34:19,780 --> 00:34:20,579
Changxuan,

481
00:34:21,960 --> 00:34:23,500
I truly thank you for saving me,

482
00:34:25,360 --> 00:34:26,619
but your presence

483
00:34:27,239 --> 00:34:28,159
has completely disrupted

484
00:34:28,159 --> 00:34:29,380
the life I once had.

485
00:34:31,380 --> 00:34:33,280
Our stations

486
00:34:33,980 --> 00:34:34,980
are worlds apart.

487
00:34:36,380 --> 00:34:38,059
Even being able to speak like this now

488
00:34:39,380 --> 00:34:40,679
is rare enough.

489
00:34:55,860 --> 00:34:57,579
My heart had just begun to grow warm,

490
00:34:59,239 --> 00:35:00,280
and your words

491
00:35:02,039 --> 00:35:03,900
throw it back into an icy cave.

492
00:35:07,539 --> 00:35:08,760
I sincerely wish you

493
00:35:08,760 --> 00:35:10,360
every happiness,

494
00:35:12,639 --> 00:35:13,840
but from now on,

495
00:35:17,619 --> 00:35:18,139
we should have

496
00:35:18,139 --> 00:35:19,760
no more contact.

497
00:36:11,280 --> 00:36:11,960
Too late.

498
00:36:15,780 --> 00:36:16,539
What did you say?

499
00:36:18,619 --> 00:36:19,239
Nothing.

500
00:36:20,880 --> 00:36:21,739
I just prayed to the gods

501
00:36:21,739 --> 00:36:22,559
that we would be

502
00:36:23,400 --> 00:36:24,500
friends for

503
00:36:24,500 --> 00:36:25,300
a lifetime.

504
00:36:33,900 --> 00:36:35,119
One must concentrate while praying.

505
00:36:37,039 --> 00:36:37,800
I am

506
00:36:38,880 --> 00:36:39,719
very devout.

507
00:38:17,659 --> 00:38:18,800
Jiang Xueting was already close in Tokyo

508
00:38:18,900 --> 00:38:20,139
to Shang Hongwen, editor-in-chief

509
00:38:20,139 --> 00:38:20,980
of a major newspaper.

510
00:38:21,579 --> 00:38:22,280
Under the banner

511
00:38:22,280 --> 00:38:23,619
of opposing warlords,

512
00:38:24,079 --> 00:38:24,639
Shang recruited

513
00:38:24,639 --> 00:38:25,679
a group of idealistic young writers

514
00:38:25,679 --> 00:38:26,559
to serve him.

515
00:38:26,820 --> 00:38:27,440
In reality,

516
00:38:27,619 --> 00:38:28,280
he was secretly

517
00:38:28,280 --> 00:38:29,260
working for regional warlords,

518
00:38:29,800 --> 00:38:30,800
using articles and newspapers

519
00:38:30,800 --> 00:38:31,760
to attack their political enemies

520
00:38:31,880 --> 00:38:32,559
for profit.

521
00:38:33,039 --> 00:38:35,480
Where is he now?

522
00:38:36,719 --> 00:38:37,719
When I led men to arrest him,

523
00:38:38,079 --> 00:38:39,159
he had already disappeared.

524
00:38:39,840 --> 00:38:40,500
But rest assured,

525
00:38:40,800 --> 00:38:41,699
I have ordered strict controls over

526
00:38:41,840 --> 00:38:43,360
every land and water route in Nanhuai.

527
00:38:45,219 --> 00:38:46,360
We must not let him escape.

528
00:38:47,300 --> 00:38:47,699
Yes.

529
00:38:53,039 --> 00:38:54,320
Secretary Jiang, a man of your talent

530
00:38:54,539 --> 00:38:55,820
has always commanded admiration.

531
00:38:55,920 --> 00:38:56,719
Now you are about to marry

532
00:38:56,719 --> 00:38:57,559
a beautiful bride as well.

533
00:38:57,780 --> 00:38:59,199
How truly enviable.

534
00:38:59,619 --> 00:39:00,760
If it were not for your wedding,

535
00:39:00,860 --> 00:39:02,099
I would never accept this resignation.

536
00:39:02,940 --> 00:39:03,820
Thank you all

537
00:39:04,039 --> 00:39:05,320
for your care during this time.

538
00:39:05,699 --> 00:39:06,579
Once Pingjun graduates,

539
00:39:06,900 --> 00:39:07,900
we will hold the wedding.

540
00:39:08,599 --> 00:39:09,119
I will certainly send invitations

541
00:39:09,119 --> 00:39:09,960
and hope you will

542
00:39:10,579 --> 00:39:11,699
all join us for a cup of wine.

543
00:39:11,860 --> 00:39:12,679
Absolutely.

544
00:39:12,780 --> 00:39:13,380
Congratulations.

545
00:39:13,400 --> 00:39:15,440
May all lovers be united.

546
00:39:15,880 --> 00:39:16,320
Thank you. Thank you.

547
00:39:16,320 --> 00:39:17,119
A hundred years of wedded bliss.

548
00:39:52,599 --> 00:39:53,500
Bring me more wine.

549
00:39:55,059 --> 00:39:56,000
Bring all you have.

550
00:40:10,179 --> 00:40:10,860
Please,

551
00:40:12,699 --> 00:40:13,719
you must not drink anymore.

552
00:40:15,539 --> 00:40:17,679
I said I want wine.

553
00:40:18,079 --> 00:40:18,760
Wine.

554
00:40:25,960 --> 00:40:27,000
Go fetch Miss Lan Qing.

555
00:40:27,800 --> 00:40:28,199
Yes.

556
00:40:54,219 --> 00:40:55,079
Where is my wine?

557
00:40:56,679 --> 00:40:57,480
You are drunk.

558
00:40:57,860 --> 00:40:58,900
More wine will injure your health.

559
00:40:59,219 --> 00:41:00,480
Give me wine.

560
00:41:01,820 --> 00:41:03,079
I stewed snow pear soup for you.

561
00:41:03,579 --> 00:41:04,400
Drink it and sober up first.

562
00:41:04,519 --> 00:41:05,619
Leave me alone.

563
00:41:10,639 --> 00:41:12,000
I have never seen you like this.

564
00:41:13,179 --> 00:41:14,460
What on earth is wrong?

565
00:41:16,300 --> 00:41:17,599
How could I let you

566
00:41:17,599 --> 00:41:18,860
marry another man?

567
00:41:22,179 --> 00:41:23,920
I will never let you

568
00:41:23,920 --> 00:41:25,119
marry another.

569
00:41:27,039 --> 00:41:28,219
Ye Pingjun.

570
00:41:31,079 --> 00:41:33,099
Ye Pingjun.

571
00:41:37,380 --> 00:41:40,300
Ye Pingjun...

572
00:41:53,539 --> 00:41:54,000
Come.

573
00:41:55,420 --> 00:41:55,880
Brother-in-law.

574
00:41:56,239 --> 00:41:57,199
Bingwen is back.

575
00:41:57,280 --> 00:41:57,559
Mother.

576
00:41:57,920 --> 00:41:58,500
Come quickly.

577
00:41:58,880 --> 00:42:00,300
Sister is on a winning streak tonight.

578
00:42:00,320 --> 00:42:01,219
She has won several rounds.

579
00:42:02,219 --> 00:42:03,659
Then let me share in that good luck.

580
00:42:11,420 --> 00:42:11,960
Mahjong.

581
00:42:12,099 --> 00:42:13,059
Won again?

582
00:42:13,059 --> 00:42:14,800
You sure are lucky.

583
00:42:17,500 --> 00:42:18,699
Madam, the rock-sugar bird's nest soup

584
00:42:18,699 --> 00:42:19,980
you ordered is ready.

585
00:42:20,579 --> 00:42:21,920
Here, set it down.

586
00:42:27,960 --> 00:42:28,519
Watch out!

587
00:42:34,420 --> 00:42:34,960
Sir.

588
00:42:35,019 --> 00:42:36,019
Are you all right?

589
00:42:37,440 --> 00:42:38,420
Sir, Miss,

590
00:42:38,800 --> 00:42:39,400
I am sorry. I am so sorry.

591
00:42:40,000 --> 00:42:40,739
You are not burned, are you?

592
00:42:41,519 --> 00:42:42,119
I am fine.

593
00:42:42,820 --> 00:42:43,199
Are you...

594
00:42:45,019 --> 00:42:46,739
Hurry, go get the burn ointment.

595
00:42:46,880 --> 00:42:47,380
Yes, yes.

596
00:42:49,460 --> 00:42:50,239
I will go treat this.

597
00:42:59,960 --> 00:43:01,139
Madam, Changxuan is back.

598
00:43:01,619 --> 00:43:03,139
Mama Zhu, if Changxuan is back,

599
00:43:03,199 --> 00:43:03,940
why are you so alarmed?

600
00:43:04,300 --> 00:43:04,820
But

601
00:43:05,159 --> 00:43:06,780
he is dead drunk.

602
00:43:06,820 --> 00:43:08,139
He had to be carried back.

603
00:43:09,940 --> 00:43:10,440
Lift your feet.

604
00:43:12,480 --> 00:43:13,019
Madam.

605
00:43:13,119 --> 00:43:14,119
How did he get like this?

606
00:43:14,300 --> 00:43:15,440
Bring a basin.

607
00:43:15,639 --> 00:43:16,059
Yes.

608
00:43:16,059 --> 00:43:16,900
Tea for rinsing.

609
00:43:16,900 --> 00:43:17,940
Easy, easy.

610
00:43:18,699 --> 00:43:19,400
Easy now.

611
00:43:21,679 --> 00:43:22,280
Hold him steady.

612
00:43:22,280 --> 00:43:23,460
Mother, take it easy.

613
00:43:24,460 --> 00:43:26,059
How did you drink this much?

614
00:43:26,059 --> 00:43:26,820
Where is the basin?

615
00:43:27,039 --> 00:43:27,239
Here.

616
00:43:32,079 --> 00:43:33,840
How could he drink this much?

617
00:43:43,539 --> 00:43:44,679
Come now, rinse your mouth.

618
00:43:48,380 --> 00:43:49,039
He swallowed it.

619
00:43:51,800 --> 00:43:53,099
Why would he do this?

620
00:43:53,440 --> 00:43:54,400
He has not been

621
00:43:54,400 --> 00:43:55,460
this drunk in a long time.

622
00:43:56,139 --> 00:43:56,519
Well,

623
00:43:58,000 --> 00:43:58,619
I do not know.

624
00:43:59,619 --> 00:44:00,280
Don't go.

625
00:44:03,719 --> 00:44:04,900
I won't let you go.

626
00:44:05,239 --> 00:44:06,239
Don't go?

627
00:44:07,119 --> 00:44:07,480
This is...

628
00:44:07,900 --> 00:44:08,960
exactly like

629
00:44:08,960 --> 00:44:10,179
the romance plays

630
00:44:10,179 --> 00:44:10,960
I read.

631
00:44:11,159 --> 00:44:12,539
He must be trapped by love,

632
00:44:12,579 --> 00:44:13,400
drinking to drown his sorrows.

633
00:44:13,539 --> 00:44:14,679
Is this what you have been

634
00:44:14,679 --> 00:44:15,800
reading in your room?

635
00:44:16,139 --> 00:44:16,599
I...

636
00:44:17,199 --> 00:44:18,079
Hush now,

637
00:44:18,199 --> 00:44:18,519
and come here.

638
00:44:20,940 --> 00:44:22,039
He has drunk far too much.

639
00:44:22,420 --> 00:44:23,019
I will go to the kitchen

640
00:44:23,019 --> 00:44:24,119
and make him some sobering soup.

641
00:44:24,719 --> 00:44:25,260
Mother, I will come too.

642
00:44:40,239 --> 00:44:40,739
Come in.

643
00:44:46,739 --> 00:44:47,480
Is Changxuan all right?

644
00:44:48,199 --> 00:44:49,199
He is heavily drunk.

645
00:44:49,400 --> 00:44:50,320
Mother is taking care of him.

646
00:44:52,519 --> 00:44:53,699
Is your burn

647
00:44:55,739 --> 00:44:56,500
serious?

648
00:44:57,039 --> 00:44:58,300
It is nothing. Just a small wound.

649
00:45:01,059 --> 00:45:02,079
This burn ointment is better than

650
00:45:02,500 --> 00:45:03,599
the kind sold in ordinary pharmacies.

651
00:45:04,079 --> 00:45:04,719
Use it.

652
00:45:05,840 --> 00:45:06,420
Jinxuan,

653
00:45:07,840 --> 00:45:09,260
do not worry too much about Changxuan.

654
00:45:10,460 --> 00:45:11,420
Something may be weighing on him.

655
00:45:12,059 --> 00:45:12,739
I will speak with him

656
00:45:13,340 --> 00:45:14,059
in a few days.

657
00:45:17,179 --> 00:45:17,960
Remember to put

658
00:45:19,079 --> 00:45:19,760
medicine on your hand.

659
00:46:02,119 --> 00:46:02,980
[Once Pingjun graduates,]

660
00:46:03,320 --> 00:46:04,420
[we will hold the wedding.]

661
00:46:05,059 --> 00:46:05,519
[I will send invitations]

662
00:46:05,519 --> 00:46:06,400
[and hope you will]

663
00:46:07,000 --> 00:46:08,119
[all join us for a cup of wine.]

664
00:46:08,460 --> 00:46:09,280
[Absolutely.]

665
00:46:09,460 --> 00:46:10,380
[Congratulations.]

666
00:46:10,719 --> 00:46:12,539
[May all lovers be united.]

667
00:46:24,239 --> 00:46:25,480
[But from now on,]

668
00:46:26,519 --> 00:46:27,079
[we should have]

669
00:46:27,079 --> 00:46:28,699
[no more contact.]
